- # `↯/s.105.1` — `Pem.Error`
+ # `↯/s.105.1` — `Pem.Error`

- Raised when Enigmatic cannot parse PEM-encoded content.
+ Levée lorsque Enigmatic ne parvient pas à analyser un contenu encodé en PEM.

- ## Cause
+ ## Cause

- PEM content has the form `-----BEGIN <label>-----` / Base64 body /
- `-----END <label>-----`. This error flags structural problems before
- the body is decoded. The message is `could not parse PEM content
+ Un contenu PEM a la forme `-----BEGIN <label>-----` / corps en Base64 /
+ `-----END <label>-----`. Cette erreur signale les problèmes de structure avant
+ que le corps ne soit décodé. Le message est `could not parse PEM content

- because $reason`.
+ because $reason`.

- ## Variants
+ ## Variantes

- ### `↯/s.105.1.1` — `BeginMissing`
+ ### `↯/s.105.1.1` — `BeginMissing`

- The opening `-----BEGIN <label>-----` line was not found.
+ La ligne d'ouverture `-----BEGIN <label>-----` est introuvable.

- **Example.** `[↯/s.105.1.1] could not parse PEM content because the BEGIN line could not be found`
+ **Exemple.** `[↯/s.105.1.1] could not parse PEM content because the BEGIN line could not be found`

- **Resolution.** Confirm the input is PEM-encoded; some sources
- strip the BEGIN/END lines and require re-wrapping.
+ **Résolution.** Vérifiez que l'entrée est encodée en PEM ; certaines sources
+ suppriment les lignes BEGIN/END et exigent de les remettre.

- ### `↯/s.105.1.2` — `EndMissing`
+ ### `↯/s.105.1.2` — `EndMissing`

- The closing `-----END <label>-----` line was not found.
+ La ligne de fermeture `-----END <label>-----` est introuvable.

- **Example.** `[↯/s.105.1.2] could not parse PEM content because the END line could not be found`
+ **Exemple.** `[↯/s.105.1.2] could not parse PEM content because the END line could not be found`

- **Resolution.** Confirm the input is complete and not truncated.
+ **Résolution.** Vérifiez que l'entrée est complète et non tronquée.

- ### `↯/s.105.1.3` — `BadBase64`
+ ### `↯/s.105.1.3` — `BadBase64`

- The body between BEGIN and END could not be decoded as Base64.
+ Le corps entre BEGIN et END n'a pas pu être décodé en Base64.

- **Example.** `[↯/s.105.1.3] could not parse PEM content because could not parse the BASE-64 PEM message`
+ **Exemple.** `[↯/s.105.1.3] could not parse PEM content because could not parse the BASE-64 PEM message`

- **Resolution.** Inspect the body for invalid characters or line
- endings; some pipelines mangle Base64 content.
+ **Résolution.** Examinez le corps à la recherche de caractères ou de fins de ligne
+ invalides ; certaines chaînes de traitement altèrent le contenu Base64.

- ### `↯/s.105.1.4` — `EmptyFile`
+ ### `↯/s.105.1.4` — `EmptyFile`

- The input was empty.
+ L'entrée était vide.

- **Example.** `[↯/s.105.1.4] could not parse PEM content because the file was empty`
+ **Exemple.** `[↯/s.105.1.4] could not parse PEM content because the file was empty`

- **Resolution.** Provide a non-empty PEM file.
+ **Résolution.** Fournissez un fichier PEM non vide.

